   "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_cards_(general)_014"
  },
  {
   "id": "ask_reason",
   "by": "model",
   "do": "Have the customer choose the dispute reason from the allowed values. Paid for one thing and received a different or cheaper one: goods_services_not_as_described. Never received it: goods_services_not_received. Charged a different amount than expected: incorrect_amount. Charge the customer did not make: unauthorized_fraudulent_charge. Subscription cancelled but still charging: canceled_subscription_still_charging. Promised refund never applied: refund_never_processed.",
   "call": null,
   "args": {},
   "lookup": [],
   "after": [
    "get_transactions"
   ],
   "if": null,
   "quote": "12. dispute_reason (string) - Ask user to select one. Must be exactly one of these values:",
   "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_cards_(general)_014"
  },
  {
   "id": "map_duplicate",
   "by": "model",
   "do": "If the customer says a charge repeats another charge (the same amount charged again), record dispute_reason = duplicate_charge.",
   "call": null,
   "args": {},
   "lookup": [
    "ask_reason",
    "get_transactions"
   ],
   "after": [
    "ask_reason"
   ],
   "if": "the customer says a charge is a repeat of another charge",
   "quote": "'duplicate_charge': Same charge appeared multiple times",
   "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_cards_(general)_014"
  },
  {
   "id": "ask_merchant",
   "by": "model",
   "do": "Ask whether the customer tried to resolve the charge with the merchant first. Record true or false.",
   "call": null,
   "args": {},
   "lookup": [],
   "after": [
    "get_transactions"
   ],
   "if": null,
   "quote": "9. contacted_merchant (boolean) - Ask user: Did you try to resolve this with the merchant first? Pass true or false",
   "doc": "doc_credit_cards_credit_cards_(general)_014"
  },
  {
   "id": "advise_merchant",
   "by": "model",
   "do": "Mention that contacting the merchant is often faster. If the customer still wants to file, continue with contacted_merchant = false. Do not refuse to file.",
   "call": null,
